# description: set, add lines with "+", take them off with "-" until it's cleared, then a line starting with a
# tilde, which replaces the description with the tilde made a "-" (stock smashed it before testing for "-", so it
# took a line off, #36), and the 1024-byte limit. Weary has no description; Decimus looks at Weary's.
@connect weary
Weary
psswrd
@return
description
description -
description A tired warrior.
description +  Leaning on a sword.
description + Yawning.
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
look weary
@as weary
description -
description -
description -
description -
description First line.
description +Second line.
description ~ and a tilde
description +0123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789
